					id: "minecraft:written_book",
					Count: true,
					tag: {
						pages: [
							'{"text":"To My Loyal Subject,\\nI am happy to say that I have been so kind to allow you to found a city in my kingdom. This of course comes with the title of Count along with it. If you haven\'t designed a banner for your royal house, now would really be the time to do so. I look forward to seeing the "}',
							'{"text":"great progress of your city, and the many taxes it will earn me! Lastly, keep it up, and you might be able to acquire higher ranks for yourself. One day, I might even bring you up as a King alongside me, so keep up the good work!\\n\\nYour King\\n"}'
						],
